window.products.push({"id":430176,"name":"Levtex Home- Spruce Spa Quilt Set - Twin Quilt + One Standard Pillow Sham - Paisley Pattern in Soft Spa and Tan Hues - Quilt Size (68 x 86) and Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1HvS0uhpLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton LEVTEX SPRUCE SPA QUILT BED SET: A rich, traditional paisley bedding set consisting of a Twin size quilt (68 x 86 ) and one matching pillow sham (26 x 20Ó).Ê Used by itself, as a layering piece or as a bedspread, this bedding set is extremely versatile. THE SPRUCE SPA DESIGN: One of our most popular quilt sets, Spruce Spa is inspired by traditional paisley patterns, with a rich, intricate paisley pattern in soft spa and tan and a charming reverse pattern of ikat stripe. A bound border provides contrast and texture to complete the look. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from 100% cotton that wonÕt ever feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable, the Spruce Spa quilt and pillow sham set has an ultra soft feel that you will simply love. Our quilt is very generously sized (68 x 86 ) to give your bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. EASY CARE: Pre washed for your convenience, the Spruce Spa quilt and pillow sham set is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR ROOM DECOR: Create a wonderful bedroom space with our coordinated reversible matching bed set. The spa and tan paisley design brings rich, traditional paisley accents into your home and will match a variety of different looks and bedroom decor. You can also freshen your room with matching throw blankets and drape panels from the Levtex Home collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1HvS0uhpLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B07Y3XY7K8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y3XY7K8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y3XY7K8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
