window.products.push({"id":430293,"name":"AWQM Futon Sofa Bed Upholstered Modern Convertible Folding Sofa Couch Sleeper for Compact Living Space, Apartment, Dorm, Removable Soft Armrest, 2 Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N-zzeDKBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality Material：This futon sofa bed is made from thickened high density sponge, which makes the cushion more resilient and will not sink like normal sofa after a long-term use. Made of 100% polyester, the tufted fabric is more breathable and durable, so there is no color fading. Sturdy ＆ Durable：Durably crafted with tufted fabric and 4 chrome aluminum legs, they not only provide better support(Weight Capacity: 6500pounds) but also can balance evenly the force. This convertible futon sofa fuses comfort and style that will last in your living space for years to come. Multipurpose：When you want to rest, you can easily lay the backrest flat, and 2 movable armrest cushions become 2 comfortable pillows, you can sleep comfortably in this bed. And the sofa has 2 hidden cup holders, make a cup of coffee, turn on the Tv and share leisure time with family or friend. Modern Style：The design of sofa bed is a classic modern simple style. The delicate upholstered fabric and the lustrous chrome plated metal legs give a simple and advanced feeling, which can decorate your space and make your room more beautiful and atmospheric. After-Sales Customer Service：Please feel free to contact us with any questions or suggestions. We are open to any feedback that will motivate us to move forward and bring a better purchasing experience to our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N-zzeDKBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AWQM","source_asin":"B0C5D1X627","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5D1X627","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5D1X627","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430294,"name":"SERENIA SLEEP 10 INCH Deluxe Height Gel Memory Foam Mattress, Made in USA (Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LZyYujxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Medium firm feel, with a soft 4-way stretch knit cover (fabric selection may vary slightly from picture) Open cell Gel memory foam is cooler than traditional memory foam, to help provide a more comfortable sleep 3 layers of comfort: 1\" Gel memory foam, 1.75\" Gel comfort foam, 7\" supportive base foam 10 year Limited Manufacturer’s Warranty -Covers all manufacturing defects and ensures you the peace of mind when buying your mattress online. Made in USA with superior quality materials and craftsmanship. Direct from manufacturer no middle men, mean that you get the most value for your money. CertiPUR US certified","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LZyYujxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serenia Sleep","source_asin":"B07GPSW6JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GPSW6JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GPSW6JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430295,"name":"Dyson DC65 Multi Floor Upright Vacuum Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":469.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710UBL3MSdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Manufacturer's Description DC65 is the most powerful upright vacuum on a ball, with the strongest suction of any vacuum*. It uses Radial Root Cyclone technology and a reconfigured brush bar to remove more dirt and dust from the home. The redesign of the brush bar means that the bristles have been made shorter and stiffer allowing deeper carpet penetration to remove more dirt, while maintaining superior performance on hard floors. The DC65 cleans better than any other vacuum across carpets and hard floors**. It achieves this through the combination of Radial Root Cyclone technology and a self adjusting cleaner head which seals in suction across carpets and hard floors. The latest Ball technology allows easy steering into difficult places. More key technologies are housed inside the ball, reducing components on the outside of the machine. Removing clutter from around the ball makes it even easier to steer under and around furniture. Other vacuums have a choice of settings for different floor types. This means that when moving from one floor type to another, suction power can be wasted. DC65 has an active base plate which self adjusts to create optimal contact with every floor type. This reduces air leaks and retains more suction power at the cleaner head. DC65 has the best all around pick-up of any Dyson vacuum.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710UBL3MSdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyson","source_asin":"B00HNUFIBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HNUFIBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HNUFIBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
