window.products.push({"id":430392,"name":"Ambesonne Watercolor Shower Curtain, Alluring Sunflowers Summer Inspired Design Agriculture, Cloth Fabric Bathroom Decor Set with Hooks, 69\" W x 70\" L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wvE4VsrwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your purchase will help victims of recent major earthquakes in Turkey since we donate a percentage of our profits to local NGOs helping with quake relief efforts. Measurements - 69” wide x 70” long. No liner needed. 12 hooks included. Made in Turkey. Made from - High quality %100 polyester Turkish fabric material. Water resistant. Non-vinyl. Non-PEVA. Easy to use - Machine washable and dries fast. Features vibrant colors and clear image. No fading. Adds great perspective - Bold graphics printed with state of the art digital printing technology. Designer artwork - Not a common usual shower curtain you can find anywhere. Unique. Genuine. Fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wvE4VsrwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B0BWJH2WQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJH2WQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJH2WQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430393,"name":"UGZOO Belt Organizer for Closet, Belt Hanger Wall Mounts to Hold 9 Belts Without Slipping, Space Saving Belt Rack for Closet Organization Includes Mou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ATM3uwSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fashionable and Functional Belt Storage Make these wardrobe essentials an eye-catching element of organization and storage in your bedroom closet. The UGZOO Wall Mounted Belt-Hanger maximizes closet space, protects fine leather and metal buckles from scratches and damage, and makes it easy to locate and select the belt that best accessorizes your attire. Rich wood construction and clever design make it an attractive and invaluable addition to your closet organizers. Made of Sturdy Paulownia Wood This light, aesthetic wood has been sanded smooth and given 9 slots to hold most fashion belts without slippage. Buckles protrude from the tops of the slots to gleaming and colorful effect, enhancing the visual appeal of the UGZOO Belt-Organizer-for-closet. Metal mounting brackets ensure stability of the belt-rack while being discreet in appearance. Each belt holder comes with 3 drywall anchors, 3 concrete anchors and 3 screws, plus detailed installation instructions so you can organize your belts right away. Perfect for Rustic Home-Decor The UGZOO Belt Rack is sleek and easy to use, holding belts where the fashionista can quickly match them to an ensemble. Its space saving design is ideal for dorm rooms, studio apartments and tiny home living. Once you experience its sophisticated simplicity, you will want to give one to every friend. Surprise a new homeowner with our belt holder as a house-warming-gift-for-new-home. Add it to first-apartment-must-haves for an adult child leaving the nest. The belt rack is an all-occasion gift for men and women with an eye for impeccable appearance and home-storage efficiency. Keep belts within easy reach while enhancing small-space-organization. Add the UGZOO Belt Organizer Holder to your closet storage solutions today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ATM3uwSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UGZOO","source_asin":"B0BGRC2HPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGRC2HPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGRC2HPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
