window.products.push({"id":430397,"name":"3D Large Wall Clock DIY Frameless Silent Non Ticking Wall Decoration Clock Stickers for Bedroom Living Room and Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MtNyhpFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.Reasons for choosing 3D DIY Wall Clock. 1) Increase the level sense of the space 2) Large Roman numerals are clear to read and can also be seen from a distance 3) Adjustable size to suit the different size wall. 2.Tips: 1) Determine the position of the adhesive before removing the back glue. 2) If you do need to re-paste, use a hair dryer or a heat gun to heat the Numbers so they won't damage your walls. 3) Requires an AA battery (Package does NOT contain batteries) 4) Had better ask someone to help you make sure the determine the spacing between the Numbers,avoiding to tear it off and paste it again. 5) Please do not use alkaline battery, the high current output would damage wall clock. 3.What's in box? 1) 12PCS Roman numerals. 2)  Clock hands. 3)  AAuxiliary scale ruler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MtNyhpFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrandName","source_asin":"B08FGTH7HT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FGTH7HT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FGTH7HT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430398,"name":"Christmas Door Cover Decoration Bowknot Photography Backdrop 35 x 71 Inch Xmas Background Bow Banner Front Door Christmas Gift for Indoor Outdoor Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CB3DkSzNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:Easy to use:Each Christmas door covering is about 90 x 180 cm/ 35 x 71 inches, enough size for decorating most doors. And the equipped cord and perforated holes for your easy hanging.Quality and reusableThe Christmas door decoration is made of vinyl, waterproof and reusable. You can fold it to store, and use it for next year. Specifications:Material: vinylMain color: redSize: Door cover: about 90 x 180 cm/ 35 x 71 inchesCord: 6 meters/ 6.56 yard in lengthPackage includes:1 x Christmas bow door coverNotes:Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size.The color may exist a slight difference due to different screen displays.Winding risk may exist, please keep away from little kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CB3DkSzNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BFGW8DMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFGW8DMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFGW8DMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430399,"name":"Ideal Home Range 16 Count Paper Guest Towel Napkins, Mad for Plaid Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+j6vEuB9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Create dynamic tablescapes and stunning place settings by pairing patterned napkins with matching plates and coordinating solids. Plates and napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. Ideal Home Range offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers, producing 100% biodegradable napkins using the safest tissues, inks and printing processes. IHR napkin tissue is 100% cellulose from cracked wood (fallen trees) and plantation wood (managed forests where trees are planted specifically for the production of paper materials) and all tissue is oxygen bleached without the use of chlorine. IHR ink is water soluble, contains no heavy metals or solvents of any kind and meets the requirements of German Food and Health laws and the USFDA. Used ink is never dumped into sewage and is always recycled and reintegrated into the color system. The production working area is naturally pollution-free and no harmful emissions are produced.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+j6vEuB9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B010HDUC16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010HDUC16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010HDUC16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430400,"name":"Green Trouble by Daniel Patrick Kessler, 14x19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zfGKCXEcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a green cat in the center of the frame with a blue sky in the background. Dan Kessleri1/2s artistic roots began in Catholic Grammar school, where nuns gave him Holy cards. These ornate depictions of religious scenes caught his eye and fired his imagination. His mother, Doris, also an artist, was also a major source of inspiration. After receiving a Bachelori1/2s degree in science from the University of Maryland in 1985, Kessler worked for several years in graphic arts and architectural design before turning to painting full time in 1991. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zfGKCXEcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B075SY3VFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075SY3VFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075SY3VFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
