window.products.push({"id":430417,"name":"MIFXIN Sectional Couch Cover Stretch Printed Spandex L-Shaped Sofa Slipcover 2 Piece Sofa Chaise Covers with Elastic Bottom for Living Room Kids Dogs ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R5klmm49L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MIFXIN Sectional Sofa Cover L Shape Sofa Couch Slipcover Furniture Protector -There are 2 pieces sofa covers, both of them are regular sofa cover design and in the same size. Only suitable for sectional sofas combined by 2 parts separately. Fit sofa length (A-A part) between 74 to 90 Inches (185cm-230cm), (B-B part) between 74 to 90 Inches (185cm-230cm). Please ensure that and measure your sofa size before purchasing. See measuring guide in our photo. How to install? Step 1: Find the \"Back\" label and make it located in the middle of the back of sofa. Step 2: Pull the sofa cover evenly over the sofa, and pull the cover to the bottom all over the sofa. Step 3: Tuck the excess fabric into gaps and insert the foam strips to the seat gaps. Step 4: Tilt the sofa up and find the ropes at the bottom of the sofa. Pull the ties together tightly and tie tightly. Step 5: Make slight adjustment to make sure it perfectly fit your sofa. Then you can enjoy your newly sofa! Attention -Do not use bleach and wash it with same/similar colors -Manual measurement 1-4cm error is allowable -The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible.Please allow a littler color difference. Package Included 2 * Sofa Slipcovers 2 * Pillow Covers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R5klmm49L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B07P6QG3SR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P6QG3SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P6QG3SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
