window.products.push({"id":430497,"name":"Stainless Steel Universal Glass Lid Replacement Knobs Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zoKPqOXWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These knobs feature a wide diameter and the extra safety of a guard that protects fingers from contacting the hot pot. Busy cooks will especially appreciate the presence of a finger guard that allows them to work quickly, without the fear of burned fingertips. Their features make these knobs suitable for the most demanding non-cookware applications as well, such as use on heat-generating appliances, wood stoves, and more. The knobs are constructed of heat-resistant plastic with a glossy black finish, which will enhance the appearance of any cookware set as they upgrade its safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zoKPqOXWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M.V. Trading","source_asin":"B07BN4QYCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BN4QYCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BN4QYCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430498,"name":"Vremi 6 pc Nonstick Cooking Utensils Set - BPA Free Nylon with Fun Colorful Silicone Handles Dishwasher Safe Kitchen Tools for Nonstick Cookware - Slo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PjNHvTWUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When it comes to operation dinner, Vremi's Kitchen Possible Cooking Utensils Set is your recipe for success. With your skills and our tools, you’ll be ready to stir, flip and serve up delicious possibilities! Set includes 1 spatula for your pancakes, 1 baster spoon for cooking juices from meat or fish, 1 soup ladle for delicious soups and stew, 1 slotted spoon for serving your veggie salad, 1 slotted turner for turning eggs, and 1 spaghetti pasta server. All are made of heat resistant nylon to prevent scratches on your cookware sets, food container or other home cooking equipment. Designed with ergonomic handles in fun colorful colors that children and kids will love. Its handles provide a comfortable grip for men and woman while cooking and add a bright color accent to any kitchens. Each cooking utensil has open hanging holes on its handle for storage hooks and comes in a sleek and lightweight design, making this set great for RV kitchens, outdoor camping, or even a picnic!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PjNHvTWUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vremi","source_asin":"B06XBNPJ89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XBNPJ89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XBNPJ89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430499,"name":"Fraser Hill Farm 58-in. Dancing Santa Claus with Prelit Christmas Tree and Wrapped Gifts | Indoor Animated Holiday Home Decor | Motion-Activated Chris","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":288.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IBPqZRMgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"I saw mommy dancing with Santa Claus! Our dancing Santa from Fraser Hill Farm will have everyone dancing and spreading holiday cheer. Standing 58 inches tall, Dancing Santa carries wrapped gifts, and a lighted Christmas tree with fifty warm white LED bulbs. When motion is detected, he will move his arms and sway his body to the song Jingle Bell Rock. Dressed in his fancy suit, his friendly face with open spectacles, round chubby cheeks, and a full beard will warm your heart. Place him in the foyer, near the fireplace, or next to the family Christmas tree, and watch as everyone starts dancing. Pair him with our Dancing Mrs. Claus in her matching outfit for an extra special display (model # FMC058-2RD5 sold separately).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IBPqZRMgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fraser Hill Farm","source_asin":"B0BLTZ3CY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLTZ3CY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLTZ3CY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430500,"name":"Nemesis Now Dark Spirits 20cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DuL0ZOlnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Take a Step closer to the spirit realm with this haunting skull! Covered with the markings of a spirit board, This Black skull has the full alphabet and numbers 1-9 printed on it, together With the words \"Yes\", \"no\", \"Hello\" And \"goodbye\". On opposing sides there are Intricate images of the sun and the moon, along With detailed baroque decorations. Cast in the finest resin before being carefully hand-painted, this piece is the perfect way to call upon the spirits of the dead.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DuL0ZOlnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nemesis Now","source_asin":"B08D4GMKTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D4GMKTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D4GMKTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430501,"name":"Befano Large Round Black Walnut Cutting Board with Deep Juice Groove for Kitchen, Circular Charcuterie Board, Serving Tray, Cheese Board, Chopping Boa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b2DMwdIYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DURABLE and STABLE】 This round wooden cutting board is made of 100% sustainable walnut wood grown in America. Black walnut wood is hard, which makes the cutting board durable and stable. The edge of the cutting board comes with a deep juice tank, which can collect all the liquid, leaving a clean table or table. 【HEAVY-DUTY MULTIPURPOSE CUTTING BOARD】The chopping board is thick and large, and it can withstand heavy meat like a turkey. It can also be used as a food tray, meat block, cheese board or pizza board; it can also be used as a cutting board to cut meat, vegetables, fruits, etc. It is the best choice for homes and restaurants. 【KNIFE-FRIENDLY and REVERSIBLE】Although the black walnut cutting board has high hardness, it will not dull the knife when cutting meat, cheese, vegetables or bread. The cutting board is a reversible design, one side can be used as a tray, and the other side can be used as a cutting board. 【PERSONALIZED PACKAGING】The eye-catching rime landscape packaging is the first choice for festivals, weddings, anniversaries, housewarming, parents' day and birthdays. Come on, present a meaningful gift for your favorite people 【LIFETIME WARRANTY】Our products provide lifetime warranty service, designed to bring customers an excellent shopping experience. All Befano products are provided with a 30-day refund and lifetime warranty, as well as 24-hour after-sales service to ensure 100% satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b2DMwdIYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Befano","source_asin":"B08CDQCZL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CDQCZL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CDQCZL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":430502,"name":"Butterfly Craze Bean Bag Chair Cover, Functional Toddler Toy Organizer, Fill with Stuffed Animals to Create a Jumbo, Comfy Floor Lounger for Boys or G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hgIRMV-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DIY STORAGE BEANIE: Can be filled with soft items such as pillows, blankets, or stuffed animals to create a comfortable bean bag chair. The perfect and cozy child floor lounger for reading, watching TV or playing games. This innovative product provides extra seating with back support for kids, toddlers, teens, and adults, boys or girls. It's easy to clean, portable, and comes in various colors to match any decor. Stuffing is not included, so, users can customize the chair to their liking. SMART & STYLISH: Butterfly Craze has come up with a solution to handle the problem of scattered stuffed animals in your home. This bean bag chair cover is a chic way to store your child's collection of plush toys. It can hold up to 100 stuffed animals and is made of high-quality materials that are soft, durable, & easy to clean. The cover is available in various colors and patterns to match any room theme. This is not just a practical storage solution but also an attractive addition to any room. SAY GOODBYE TO MESSY ROOMS: There's no more nagging with this clever solution: a bean bag chair that doubles as a storage bag for plush toys. Simply fill the bag with stuffies, zip it up, and voila - a cozy chair for your child to lounge on. The modern design adds a touch of elegance to any room and is a practical solution to the age-old problem of cluttered play areas. This not only encourages your children to keep their rooms clean but also teaches them responsibility and organization. A GAME CHANGER: Parents, rejoice! This extra-large storage bag is a game-changer for keeping your kids' playroom or bedroom tidy. Measuring a whopping 50\" long x 30\" wide x 35\" tall, this bag can hold up to 200 liters of soft items like clothes, bedding, and toys. With its massive capacity, it's the perfect solution for keeping your child's room organized and clutter-free. Whether you need to store seasonal decorations or rotate clothes between seasons, this bag is a must-have for any family. QUALITY MATERIALS & CONSTRUCTION: Made with a sturdy cotton canvas fabric that can withstand regular use. The durable metal zippers ensure that the filling remains secure and in place. The machine-washable fabric allows for easy cleaning and maintenance. Designed to be versatile & customizable, allowing you to create a comfortable and personalized seating experience. With its quality materials and construction, this bean bag cover is built to last and provide optimal comfort for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hgIRMV-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butterfly Craze","source_asin":"B0915Y8SWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0915Y8SWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0915Y8SWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
