window.products.push({"id":430660,"name":"Dubbas - Square Paneer Maker, Easy to Use 5.25\" Stainless Steel Indian Paneer/Tofu Press Mould","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hvr5zaa-S._AC_SL1109_.jpg","description":"Make paneer with ease at home. Use this square shape stainless steel Paneer Maker press to make restaurant style paneer at home without the unwanted ingredients in the paneer. It is a 3 piece container with removable base and lid. Made from superior quality food grade steel. It is sturdy, durable and dishwasher safe.  How to use the paneer maker mould? 1. Remove the lid and slide the base of the container in place. Place the paneer maker on a plate. 2. Place a cotton malmal cloth in the paneer maker base. 3. Strain curdled milk and place inside the container on top of the cloth.  4. Place the lid and press the lid from the top to drain all the water. Throw away the collected water in the plate and continue... 5. Place a heavy weight on the lid and leave for 30 minutes to an hour to drain out all the liquid 6. Remove the weight keep the paneer maker in the fridge for 3 to 4 hours. 7. Flip the container and push the base to slide out nice firm paneer which is ready for cooking - whether you want to use it to grill, fry or cook your favorite curry.  Dimension - 5.25\" square, about 1.5\" height  Note: Please take precaution when using the paneer maker as the base plate has sharp edges. Do not press against edges with fingers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hvr5zaa-S._AC_SL1109_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"desiclik.com","source_asin":"B083RJKPHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-430660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083RJKPHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083RJKPHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
